{"kind":"html","caption":"用动态规划逐格计算到达当前位置的最小路径和：每个格子只需比较上方和左侧的结果，再加上自身数值。动画使用示例 1 展示初始化、状态转移和最终回溯，右下角得到最小路径和 7。蓝色格子表示当前计算位置，深蓝色格子表示最终最优路径。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>最小路径和可视化</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  main{ max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 8px 10px 10px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 4px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .intro { margin: 0 0 6px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 12px; }\n  .formula { margin-top: 6px; padding: 8px 10px; border-left: 3px solid #3794ff; background: #2a2d2e; font-size: 11px; }\n  .mono, .value, .sum { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .boards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-top: 8px; }\n  .panel { padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; }\n  .panel h2 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 4px; }\n  .cell { min-height: 44px; padding: 4px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 4px; background: #2d2d30; text-align: center; transition: background .35s, border-color .35s; }\n  .cell .value { font-size: 13px; }\n  .cell .label { display: block; margin-top: 2px; font-size:10px; color: #8d8d8d; }\n  .cell.current { background: #173d5c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .cell.source { border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .cell.path { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .cell.path .value, .cell.path .sum { color: #fff; }\n  .sum { font-size: 13px; }\n  .empty { color: #8d8d8d; }\n  .explain { margin-top: 8px; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 6px; background: #252526; }\n  .step-line { min-height: auto; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; }\n  .step-title { color: #3794ff; font-weight: 600; }\n  .legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px 10px; margin-top: 6px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 10px; }\n  .swatch { width: 12px; height: 12px; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 2px; background: #2d2d30; }\n  .swatch.current { background: #173d5c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .swatch.path { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .progress { margin-top: 6px; height: 3px; border-radius: 4px; background: #3c3c3c; overflow: hidden; }\n  .progress-bar { width: 0; height: 100%; background: #3794ff; transition: width .35s; }\n  .note { margin-top: 6px; color: #8d8d8d; font-size: 11px; }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <h1>最小路径和：让每个格子记住最优答案</h1>\n  <p class=\"intro\">示例：<span class=\"mono\">grid = [[1,3,1],[1,5,1],[4,2,1]]</span>。因为只能向右或向下，进入任意格子时只可能来自上方或左侧。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"formula\">\n    状态定义：<span class=\"mono\">dp[i][j]</span> 表示从左上角到 <span class=\"mono\">(i,j)</span> 的最小路径和。<br>\n    转移：<span class=\"mono\">dp[i][j] = grid[i][j] + min(dp[i-1][j], dp[i][j-1])</span>。\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"boards\">\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <h2>原始网格 grid</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid\" id=\"gridBoard\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"panel\">\n      <h2>动态规划表 dp</h2>\n      <div class=\"grid\" id=\"dpBoard\"></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"explain\">\n    <div class=\"step-line\" id=\"stepText\"></div>\n    <div class=\"legend\">\n      <div class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"swatch current\"></span>正在计算</div>\n      <div class=\"legend-item\"><span class=\"swatch path\"></span>最终最优路径</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"progress\"><div class=\"progress-bar\" id=\"progressBar\"></div></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <p class=\"note\">边界上只有一个来向：第一行只能从左边到达，第一列只能从上边到达。填完整张表后，右下角的 <span class=\"mono\">dp[2][2] = 7</span> 就是答案；时间复杂度为 <span class=\"mono\">O(mn)</span>。</p>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const grid = [[1,3,1],[1,5,1],[4,2,1]];\n  const dpFinal = [[1,4,5],[2,7,6],[6,8,7]];\n  const order = [[0,0],[0,1],[0,2],[1,0],[1,1],[1,2],[2,0],[2,1],[2,2]];\n  const path = new Set(['0,0','0,1','0,2','1,2','2,2']);\n  const gridBoard = document.getElementById('gridBoard');\n  const dpBoard = document.getElementById('dpBoard');\n  const stepText = document.getElementById('stepText');\n  const progressBar = document.getElementById('progressBar');\n  const gridCells = [];\n  const dpCells = [];\n\n  for (let i = 0; i < 3; i++) {\n    for (let j = 0; j < 3; j++) {\n      const g = document.createElement('div');\n      g.className = 'cell';\n      g.innerHTML = `<span class=\"value\">${grid[i][j]}</span><span class=\"label\">位置 (${i}, ${j})</span>`;\n      gridBoard.appendChild(g);\n      gridCells.push(g);\n\n      const d = document.createElement('div');\n      d.className = 'cell';\n      d.innerHTML = `<span class=\"sum empty\">—</span><span class=\"label\">dp[${i}][${j}]</span>`;\n      dpBoard.appendChild(d);\n      dpCells.push(d);\n    }\n  }\n\n  function index(i, j) { return i * 3 + j; }\n\n  function calculation(i, j) {\n    const own = grid[i][j];\n    if (i === 0 && j === 0) return `起点直接计入：<span class=\"mono\">dp[0][0] = ${own}</span>`;\n    if (i === 0) return `第一行只能从左侧到达：<span class=\"mono\">${dpFinal[i][j-1]} + ${own} = ${dpFinal[i][j]}</span>`;\n    if (j === 0) return `第一列只能从上方到达：<span class=\"mono\">${dpFinal[i-1][j]} + ${own} = ${dpFinal[i][j]}</span>`;\n    return `比较上方 ${dpFinal[i-1][j]} 与左侧 ${dpFinal[i][j-1]}：<span class=\"mono\">min(${dpFinal[i-1][j]}, ${dpFinal[i][j-1]}) + ${own} = ${dpFinal[i][j]}</span>`;\n  }\n\n  let step = 0;\n  function render() {\n    gridCells.forEach(c => c.className = 'cell');\n    dpCells.forEach((c, k) => {\n      c.className = 'cell';\n      const filled = k < step && step <= order.length;\n      const i = Math.floor(k / 3), j = k % 3;\n      c.innerHTML = filled\n        ? `<span class=\"sum\">${dpFinal[i][j]}</span><span class=\"label\">dp[${i}][${j}]</span>`\n        : `<span class=\"sum empty\">—</span><span class=\"label\">dp[${i}][${j}]</span>`;\n    });\n\n    if (step < order.length) {\n      const [i, j] = order[step];\n      gridCells[index(i,j)].classList.add('current');\n      dpCells[index(i,j)].classList.add('current');\n      if (i > 0) dpCells[index(i-1,j)].classList.add('source');\n      if (j > 0) dpCells[index(i,j-1)].classList.add('source');\n      stepText.innerHTML = `<span class=\"step-title\">第 ${step + 1} 步：</span><span class=\"calc\">${calculation(i,j)}</span>`;\n      progressBar.style.width = `${(step / order.length) * 100}%`;\n    } else {\n      dpCells.forEach((c, k) => {\n        const i = Math.floor(k / 3), j = k % 3;\n        c.innerHTML = `<span class=\"sum\">${dpFinal[i][j]}</span><span class=\"label\">dp[${i}][${j}]</span>`;\n        if (path.has(`${i},${j}`)) {\n          c.classList.add('path');\n          gridCells[k].classList.add('path');\n        }\n      });\n      stepText.innerHTML = `<span class=\"step-title\">完成：</span><span class=\"calc\">沿较小的前驱反向回溯，得到路径 <span class=\"mono\">1 → 3 → 1 → 1 → 1</span>，总和为 <span class=\"mono\">7</span>。</span>`;\n      progressBar.style.width = '100%';\n    }\n    step = (step + 1) % (order.length + 1);\n  }\n\n  render();\n  setInterval(render, 1800);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":"","time_complexity":"O(mn)","space_complexity":"O(mn)","complexity_note":"m、n 为网格的行数、列数. 演示保留二维 dp 表以回溯路径; 填表 O(mn), 回溯 O(m + n). 若只求最小和可滚动到 O(n), 或原地覆盖输入到 O(1)."}
